# Touchstone-86, mul_fault: a CPU that decodes MUL BX as IMUL BX: test 06 fails at row 07, DX wrong.
# For DS2 (HI on the silk): set CONST ROLE = 2 in Touchstone.bas.
# Written by TTLSim's TouchstoneRomTests from tstrom.asm on Ida's 8086 core at 4 MHz; not edited by hand.
# Power-on at 0; the CPU leaves reset at 250 ms.
THING OledThing
0.000 B=C3
250.024 B=01
346.229 B=02
446.234 B=03
546.239 B=04
646.244 B=05
746.249 B=06
846.246 B=A6
846.874 B=F6
END 1438.000
